<title>CHINA: CHEUNG WAH YR NET LOSS HK$35.44 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEUNG WAH YR NET LOSS HK$35.44 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.0 loss   vs 1.4 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  20.88 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    35.44 loss vs 8.35 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     263.04     vs 280.67</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cheung Wah Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheung Wah Development is a dyeing, printing and dyestuffs distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$1.47 million on disposal of land and buildings, loss of HK$2.20 million on provision for long service payments, loss of HK$3.02 million on provision for doubtful debts, loss of HK$12.18 million on provision for diminution in value of an associated company, loss of HK$4.29 million on severance payments and gain of HK$2.27 million on disposal of land use rights in China, net of tax.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
